T2  - 2019 7TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON FUTURE INTERNET OF THINGS AND CLOUD (FICLOUD 2019)
CP  - 7th International Conference on Future Internet of Things and Cloud (FiCloud)
KW  - Cloud Computing
