TI  - Privacy-aware relationship semantics-based XACML access control model for electronic health records in hybrid cloud
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF DISTRIBUTED SENSOR NETWORKS
KW  - Electronic health records
KW  - hybrid cloud
KW  - privacy
KW  - relationship
KW  - access control
