T2  - 2021 4TH INTERNATIONAL SEMINAR ON RESEARCH OF INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY AND INTELLIGENT SYSTEMS (ISRITI 2021)
CP  - 4th International Seminar on Research of Information Technology and Intelligent Systems (ISRITI)
