TI  - Research on Access Control Strategies for Medical Data Interaction Platform Based on Cloud Services
T2  - 3RD ANNUAL INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON INFORMATION SYSTEM AND ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE (ISAI2018)
CP  - 3rd Annual International Conference on Information System and Artificial Intelligence (ISAI)
AB  - Cloud computing technology is widely used in the field of medical information, providing strong technical support for the information construction of medical and health institutions, but at the same time it also brings privacy disclosure of medical data and hidden dangers of medical information insecurity. Control is one of the key technologies in the privacy and security protection of medical data in cloud services. This paper aims at the limitations of the RBAC model applied to the SaaS model, improves it, and proposes a Service-Oriented Multi-tenant Access Control (SMTAC) strategy to meet the needs of the software rental service to provide security for multiple healthcare organizations in the region at the SaaS model.
