TI  - Achieving Decentralized and Dynamic SSO-Identity Access Management System for Multi-Application Outsourced in Cloud
T2  - IEEE ACCESS
KW  - Authentication
KW  - Access control
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Authorization
KW  - Blockchains
