TI  - Provably Secure Fine-Grained Data Access Control Over Multiple Cloud Servers in Mobile Cloud Computing Based Healthcare Applications
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON INDUSTRIAL INFORMATICS
KW  - Attribute-based encryption
KW  - distributed mobile cloud computing (MCC)
KW  - fine-grained access control
KW  - healthcare industry 4.0
