KW  - Google services
KW  - Google OAuth
AB  - Every day, new software applications appear and, commonly, these applications need to implement an authorization system. Usually, some applications are focused on specific communities such as universities. In this case, managing the credentials of every application could be tedious for the members of the community. In addition, applications need different hardware requirements for the right performance of some features, which might be very expensive in some cases. Fortunately, big companies such as Google and Microsoft offer suites to some organizations like universities; then, universities can seize said suites to improve their business processes. In this paper, we present an approach for building applications using a microservices architecture and taking advantage of Google Workspace.
