TI  - HOW SECURE IS YOUR CLOUD: CLASSIFICATION OF SECURITY THREATS AND COUNTERMEASURES WITHIN CLOUD COMPUTING?
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF COMPUTER SCIENCE AND NETWORK SECURITY
KW  - Cloud Computing
