TI  - A Dynamic Solution for Fine-Grained Policy Conflict Resolution
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF 2019 THE 3RD INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON CRYPTOGRAPHY, SECURITY AND PRIVACY (ICCSP 2019) WITH WORKSHOP 2019 THE 4TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON MULTIMEDIA AND IMAGE PROCESSING (ICMIP 2019)
