TI  - Blowfish Hybridized Weighted Attribute-Based Encryption for Secure and Efficient Data Collaboration in Cloud Computing
T2  - APPLIED SCIENCES-BASEL
KW  - cloud computing
KW  - secure write operation
KW  - data encryption
KW  - key management scheme
KW  - fine grained access control
KW  - multiauthority security
