TI  - A Secure G-Cloud-Based Framework for Government Healthcare Services
T2  - IEEE ACCESS
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - electronic health record
KW  - security
KW  - attribute-based encryption
KW  - ciphertext policy
KW  - identity proofing
