TI  - TMABKS: a traceable multi authority attribute-based Boolean keywords search authorization for e-health records in cloud
T2  - CLUSTER COMPUTING-THE JOURNAL OF NETWORKS SOFTWARE TOOLS AND APPLICATIONS
KW  - Privacy
KW  - Preserving
