TI  - Research of Fine Grit Access Control Based on Time in Cloud Computing
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF 2019 IEEE 3RD INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY, NETWORKING, ELECTRONIC AND AUTOMATION CONTROL CONFERENCE (ITNEC 2019)
