TI  - Managing Security Policies within Cloud Environments Using Aspect-Oriented State Machines
T2  - 2019 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON ADVANCED COMMUNICATION TECHNOLOGIES AND NETWORKING (COMMNET)
CP  - 2nd International Conference on Advanced Communication Technologies and Networking (CommNet)
KW  - XACML policies
