TI  - An Adaptive Secure and Practical Data Sharing System With Verifiable Outsourced Decryption
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON SERVICES COMPUTING
KW  - Security
KW  - Access control
KW  - Standards
KW  - Encryption
