TI  - CAPODAZ: A containerised authorisation and policy-driven architecture using microservices
T2  - AD HOC NETWORKS
KW  - Microservices
KW  - Containerised
KW  - Policy-driven authorisation
KW  - Cloud-IoT
KW  - ACCESS-CONTROL
KW  - CLOUD
