TI  - Secure data access control with perception reasoning
T2  - ADCAIJ-ADVANCES IN DISTRIBUTED COMPUTING AND ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE JOURNAL
KW  - Secure Data
KW  - Access Control
KW  - Context Aware
KW  - Entities Management
