TI  - A Delegatable Attribute Based Encryption Scheme for a Collaborative E-Health Cloud
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON SERVICES COMPUTING
KW  - Cryptography
KW  - Hospitals
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Medical services
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Collaboration
KW  - Data privacy
