TI  - IoT-Cloud Integration Security: A Survey of Challenges, Solutions, and Directions
T2  - ELECTRONICS
KW  - IoT and cloud security
KW  - cybersecurity
KW  - lightweight cryptography
KW  - adversarial AI
KW  - resource-constrained IoT devices
KW  - IoT and blockchain
