AB  - The Superfacility API brings automation to the use of High Performance Computing (HPC) systems. Our aim is to enable scientists to reliably automate their interactions with computational resources at the National Energy Research Scientific Computing Center (NERSC), removing human intervention from the process of transferring, analyzing, and managing data. In this paper, we describe the science use cases that drive the API design, our schema of API endpoints, and implementation details and considerations, including authentication and authorization. We also discuss future plans, working toward our vision of supporting entirely automated experiment-network-HPC workflows.
