TI  - Dual Attribute-Based Auditing Scheme for Fog Computing-Based Data Dynamic Storage With Distributed Collaborative Verification
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON NETWORK AND SERVICE MANAGEMENT
KW  - Servers
KW  - Distributed databases
