AB  - This paper focuses on the discussion on access control technology of cloud computing. On the basis of briefly describing the composition and principle of access control technology, this paper analyzes some problems existing in cloud computing access control. Moreover, it presents key technologies for cloud access control. It is concluded that the scientific and reasonable application of cloud computing access control technology can effectively guarantee the security of cloud computing resources to provide some help to the relevant cloud computing staff.
