TI  - Bolstering the Mobile Cloud: Addressing Emerging Threats and Strengthening Multi-Layered Defenses for Robust Mobile Security
T2  - 2023 10TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON INTERNET OF THINGS: SYSTEMS, MANAGEMENT AND SECURITY, IOTSMS
