TI  - Instantiation and Implementation of HEAD Metamodel in an Industrial Environment: Non-IoT and IoT Case Studies
T2  - ELECTRONICS
KW  - access control
KW  - metamodel
KW  - security and privacy
KW  - policy
KW  - DSL
KW  - cybersecurity
