TI  - Fast and Privacy-Preserving Attribute-Based Keyword Search in Cloud Document Services
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON SERVICES COMPUTING
KW  - Keyword search
KW  - Cryptography
KW  - Indexes
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Security
