AB  - Mobile Cloud Computing incorporates Cloud computing paradigma into the mobile environment, the set of technologies that enable to access network services anyplace, anytime and anywhere. This faces many technical challenges, such as low bandwidth, availability, heterogeneity, computing offloads, data accessing, security, privacy, and trust. In this paper the MCC security solution developed and applied within the STMicroelectronics plants is presented.
