TI  - SimLESS: A Secure Deduplication System Over Similar Data in Cloud Media Sharing
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON INFORMATION FORENSICS AND SECURITY
KW  - Media
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Security
