AB  - This work presents the solution used within STMicroelectronics to grant security in Mobile Cloud computing (MCC), where Cloud computing paradigma meets the mobile environment, the enabling technology to provide access network services anyplace, anytime and anywhere. We first illustrate the scenario, then MCC main issues are introduced, and the corresponding solution in the STMicroelectronics case is shown and briefly discussed.
