TI  - ESMAC: Efficient and Secure Multi-Owner Access Control With TEE in Multi-Level Data Processing
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON DEPENDABLE AND SECURE COMPUTING
KW  - Process control
KW  - Context
KW  - Authorization
KW  - Privacy
KW  - Hospitals
