TI  - Security and Privacy Requirements for Cloud Computing in Healthcare: Elicitation and Prioritization from a Patient Perspective
T2  - ACM TRANSACTIONS ON MANAGEMENT INFORMATION SYSTEMS
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - healthcare
