TI  - Lightweight verifiable data management system for cloud-assisted wireless body area networks
T2  - PEER-TO-PEER NETWORKING AND APPLICATIONS
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Wireless body area networks (WBANs)
KW  - Fine-grained access control
KW  - Fine-grained search control
KW  - Remote data integrity checking
KW  - ATTRIBUTE-BASED ENCRYPTION
KW  - GRAINED ACCESS-CONTROL
KW  - EFFICIENT
KW  - SEARCH
