TI  - Scalability of Container Overlays for Policy Enforcement in Digital Marketplaces
T2  - PROCEEDING OF THE 2019 IEEE 8TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON CLOUD NETWORKING (CLOUDNET)
CP  - 8th IEEE International Conference on Cloud Networking (CloudNet)
