TI  - An Efficient Ciphertext-Policy Weighted Attribute-Based Encryption for the Internet of Health Things
T2  - IEEE JOURNAL OF BIOMEDICAL AND HEALTH INFORMATICS
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Medical services
KW  - Security
KW  - Access control
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Surgery
