TI  - RS-HABE: Revocable-Storage and Hierarchical Attribute-Based Access Scheme for Secure Sharing of e-Health Records in Public Cloud
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON DEPENDABLE AND SECURE COMPUTING
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Servers
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Medical diagnostic imaging
KW  - Access control
KW  - Personal e-health records
KW  - fine-grained access control
