TI  - Flexible and Efficient Blockchain-Based ABE Scheme With Multi-Authority for Medical on Demand in Telemedicine System
T2  - IEEE ACCESS
KW  - Attribute-based encryption
KW  - blockchain
KW  - independent-update
KW  - multi-authority
KW  - medical on demand
