AB  - In this article, solutions to the problem of authentication data protection are given, in particular, authentication methods based on one-time use (single sign-on and single sign-on) are studied, and the protocol for using single sign-on technology is analyzed. The scheme of the hidden protocol (implicit flow) and the main authentication protocol (authorization code flow) are shown.
