TI  - Secure crowd-sensing protocol for fog-based vehicular cloud
T2  - FUTURE GENERATION COMPUTER SYSTEMS-THE INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ESCIENCE
KW  - Privacy preservation
KW  - Crowd-sensing
KW  - Fog enabled vehicular computing
KW  - Access control
KW  - ID-based signature
