TI  - BLOCK PUBLIC ACCESS: Trust Safety Verification of Access Control Policies
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 28TH ACM JOINT MEETING ON EUROPEAN SOFTWARE ENGINEERING CONFERENCE AND SYMPOSIUM ON THE FOUNDATIONS OF SOFTWARE ENGINEERING (ESEC/FSE '20)
CP  - 28th ACM Joint Meeting on European Software Engineering Conference and Symposium on the Foundations of Software Engineering (ESEC/FSE)
