TI  - An Efficient Ciphertext-Policy Attribute-Based Encryption Scheme with Policy Update
T2  - CMC-COMPUTERS MATERIALS & CONTINUA
KW  - Ciphertext-policy attribute-based encryption
KW  - key encapsulation mechanism
KW  - access structure
KW  - all-or-nothing transform
