TI  - O3-R-CP-ABE: An Efficient and Revocable Attribute-Based Encryption Scheme in the Cloud-Assisted IoMT System
T2  - IEEE INTERNET OF THINGS JOURNAL
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Servers
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Ecosystems
