TI  - Trust-Based Secure Multi-Cloud Collaboration Framework in Cloud-Fog-Assisted IoT
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON CLOUD COMPUTING
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - multi-cloud service composition
KW  - secure collaboration
KW  - single sign-on
KW  - role-based access control
