TI  - Efficient Collaborative Access Control Encryption Scheme for Cloud Storage
T2  - IEEE INTERNET OF THINGS JOURNAL
KW  - Collaboration
KW  - Access control
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Cryptography
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Security
KW  - Internet of Things
