AB  - With the increasing popularity of cloud computing products, task scheduling problem has become a hot research topic in this field. The task scheduling problem of cloud computing system is more complex than the traditional distributed system. Based on the analysis of cloud computing in related literature, we established a simplified model for task scheduling system in cloud computing. Different from the previous research of cloud computing task scheduling algorithm, the simplified model in this paper is based on game theory as a mathematical tool. Based on game theory, the task scheduling algorithm considering the reliability of the balanced task is proposed. Based on the balanced scheduling algorithm, the task scheduling model for computing nodes is proposed. In the cooperative game model, game strategy is used for the task in the calculation of rate allocation strategy on the node. Through analysis of experimental results, it is shown that the proposed algorithm has better optimization effect. (C) 2017 Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.
