TI  - Secure data outsourcing in presence of the inference problem: issues and directions
T2  - JOURNAL OF INFORMATION AND TELECOMMUNICATION
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - data outsourcing
KW  - access control
KW  - inference leakage
KW  - secrecy and privacy
