TI  - Multi-Client Verifiable Encrypted Keyword Search Scheme With Authorization Over Outsourced Encrypted Data
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON NETWORK SCIENCE AND ENGINEERING
KW  - Cryptography
KW  - Indexes
KW  - Keyword search
KW  - Servers
KW  - Homomorphic encryption
